# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Generate index.html for the DISC replica from reference data in questions.json.
No human-typed question data or step labels exist in this file's source:
the 24 questions (with 4 items each) and the 8 step labels are read verbatim
from questions.json at build time, so the output cannot drift from the source.
